  <name>Project Foxy</name>
  <summary>Fast image viewer and editor with GIF maker, collage and compare</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Project Foxy opens JPEG, PNG, WebP, TIFF, BMP, GIF, ICO, HEIC/HEIF, AVIF and camera RAW files quickly, with a thumbnail
      bar, smooth GPU zoom, slideshow and a before/after comparison.
    </p>
    <p>
      It also edits: crop, rotate, resize, light and colour adjustments with levels and curves, ready-made looks, more than
      forty effects, lens correction, frames and captions. It can make animated GIF, APNG and WebP files, build collages and
      process many pictures at once.
    </p>
    <p>The interface is available in English, Spanish, Portuguese, Korean, Chinese and Japanese.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.vulob1.ProjectFoxy.desktop</launchable>
